1
00:00:46,799 --> 00:00:47,359
Hurry, hurry!

2
00:00:47,359 --> 00:00:47,920
Quick, take a look.

3
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:49,719
Dad, how is it, Dad?

4
00:00:51,520 --> 00:00:52,479
Tianting,

5
00:00:52,479 --> 00:00:53,719
why are you being so mischievous?

6
00:00:53,719 --> 00:00:54,920
Why did you reach your hand down?

7
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:55,920
I grabbed the wrong hand.

8
00:00:56,039 --> 00:00:57,200
I didn't reach my hand down.

9
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:10,159
Quick, go get a knife!

10
00:01:10,159 --> 00:01:11,840
I'm going to chop this hand off.

11
00:01:14,920 --> 00:01:15,959
Master.

12
00:01:16,480 --> 00:01:18,840
He can still walk with two extra hands.

13
00:01:18,959 --> 00:01:20,400
It's better than having broken legs.

14
00:01:20,760 --> 00:01:21,120
Exactly.

15
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:21,680
It's just...

16
00:01:22,200 --> 00:01:23,840
buying shoes won't be easy.

17
00:01:24,079 --> 00:01:24,760
You...

18
00:01:26,560 --> 00:01:27,920
Hurry up and go!

19
00:01:39,840 --> 00:01:41,040
Chief Leng.

20
00:01:41,760 --> 00:01:43,280
You followed the scent here.

21
00:01:43,280 --> 00:01:44,599
Where is the stuff I asked for?

22
00:01:45,439 --> 00:01:47,400
I've had it ready for you.

23
00:01:47,560 --> 00:01:48,319
Take a look.

24
00:01:48,840 --> 00:01:50,480
I even gave you extra.

25
00:01:50,760 --> 00:01:51,959
Doing business with me...

26
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:54,200
...guarantees you a profit.

27
00:01:55,719 --> 00:01:56,799
You kept your word.

28
00:01:57,519 --> 00:01:58,280
I'm off.

29
00:01:58,680 --> 00:01:59,519
Chief Leng.

30
00:02:00,319 --> 00:02:01,879
I have another job for you.

31
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:02,799
Are you interested?

32
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:05,879
You already have the Curse Scripture and the Celestial Seal.

33
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:07,760
What more do you want?

34
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:08,759
Look into someone for me.

35
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:10,639
Li Xiao.

36
00:02:12,479 --> 00:02:14,479
He also wants the position of Chief.

37
00:02:15,599 --> 00:02:17,280
A warlord's son like him...

38
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:19,199
...wants to find the Tidal Tomb from twenty years ago?

39
00:02:20,560 --> 00:02:22,479
Even if he has a strong army...

40
00:02:22,479 --> 00:02:24,240
...and a fate as tough as yours,

41
00:02:24,639 --> 00:02:26,719
...without the guidance of the Dragon-Seeking Lineage,

42
00:02:26,719 --> 00:02:28,400
...he wouldn't even know where the tomb's entrance is.

43
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:29,120
Exactly.

44
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:31,000
If he becomes Chief...

45
00:02:31,759 --> 00:02:33,639
...it probably isn't to raid tombs and suppress evil.

46
00:02:36,240 --> 00:02:36,919
I think...

47
00:02:37,919 --> 00:02:40,120
...he wants to swallow up The Four Great Families.

48
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:42,039
That's why...

49
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:46,240
...I want your help to find the Qi family's Talisman Book ASAP.

50
00:02:46,319 --> 00:02:47,680
And the Wan family's Yin-Yang Eyes.

51
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:50,560
I absolutely can't let him become the Chief before me.

52
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:51,680
Help you?

53
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:55,080
But I've already gotten what I wanted.

54
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:57,319
What else can you offer me?

55
00:02:57,319 --> 00:02:59,080
There must be something else you want.

56
00:02:59,120 --> 00:03:00,319
Why don't you think about it?

57
00:03:01,319 --> 00:03:03,159
My corpse poison isn't completely cleared.

58
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:04,879
You'll continue to clear the poison for me.

59
00:03:05,199 --> 00:03:06,120
Come here.

60
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:09,639
I...

61
00:03:09,639 --> 00:03:10,639
Last time I cleared it for you...

62
00:03:10,639 --> 00:03:11,800
Young Master, bad news!

63
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:18,280
It's not what you think.

64
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:19,599
I was just clearing her poison.

65
00:03:19,879 --> 00:03:21,400
What is it? Spit it out.

66
00:03:22,759 --> 00:03:24,879
A guy named Li Xiao has our house surrounded with his men!

67
00:03:24,879 --> 00:03:25,919
He says he's here to catch an adulterer.

68
00:03:28,479 --> 00:03:30,159
He showed up at our door this fast?

69
00:03:30,360 --> 00:03:31,520
Catch an adulterer?

70
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:33,919
I'm not getting involved in this.

71
00:03:47,879 --> 00:03:48,680
Jiushuang,

72
00:03:49,199 --> 00:03:51,199
this marriage was arranged by our families.

73
00:03:51,479 --> 00:03:52,759
With this behavior of yours,

74
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:54,759
how does that make the Li family look?

75
00:03:55,680 --> 00:03:57,120
So the Li family's reputation matters,

76
00:03:57,240 --> 00:03:58,879
but my life doesn't?

77
00:03:58,919 --> 00:03:59,719
Wait.

78
00:04:01,719 --> 00:04:03,719
Did these despicable people from the Sheng family

79
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:04,960
put a spell on you?

80
00:04:05,599 --> 00:04:07,360
The Sheng family treats guests well,

81
00:04:07,479 --> 00:04:08,759
but it depends on who they are.

82
00:04:09,599 --> 00:04:11,000
I was wondering who it was.

83
00:04:11,159 --> 00:04:14,280
Turns out it's a prodigy who mooches off two families.

84
00:04:14,520 --> 00:04:15,439
Young Master Li.

85
00:04:15,639 --> 00:04:17,040
You can't force love.

86
00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:18,240
It just needs to quench my thirst.

87
00:04:19,439 --> 00:04:20,240
Jiushuang,

88
00:04:20,839 --> 00:04:23,079
why do you insist on being with him?

89
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:23,759
Well...

90
00:04:24,439 --> 00:04:26,000
Because I'm the one she loves.

91
00:04:26,319 --> 00:04:26,920
You...

92
00:04:26,920 --> 00:04:28,040
Is that so hard to understand?

93
00:04:28,199 --> 00:04:28,759
Rat,

94
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:29,720
do you understand?

95
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:30,680
Of course I do.

96
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:31,439
Even a pig could.

97
00:04:31,439 --> 00:04:32,240
I...

98
00:04:33,319 --> 00:04:34,120
I don't get it.

99
00:04:35,879 --> 00:04:38,000
If I don't teach you all a lesson,

100
00:04:38,079 --> 00:04:39,879
you'll really think I'm here to joke around.

101
00:04:40,519 --> 00:04:42,040
Head of the Sheng family, right?

102
00:04:42,040 --> 00:04:42,920
Let me tell you,

103
00:04:43,160 --> 00:04:46,079
to me, you're all less than ants.

104
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:47,399
Jiushuang,

105
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:48,720
come back with me.

106
00:04:49,759 --> 00:04:50,800
Li Xiao, right?

107
00:04:50,839 --> 00:04:53,519
Marrying Miss Mei is just a front.

108
00:04:54,160 --> 00:04:57,360
You're actually after this, aren't you?

109
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:01,240
The Celestial Seal.

110
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:03,519
Look. It really is for the Celestial Seal.

111
00:05:05,079 --> 00:05:06,279
Mei Jiushuang,

112
00:05:06,839 --> 00:05:09,639
you actually gave the Mei family's greatest treasure to an outsider?

113
00:05:09,639 --> 00:05:12,480
Compared to a two-faced person like you,

114
00:05:13,240 --> 00:05:14,800
he's much more worthy of my trust.

115
00:05:16,639 --> 00:05:18,000
Fine, fine, fine.

116
00:05:18,199 --> 00:05:19,560
In that case,

117
00:05:20,079 --> 00:05:21,439
if I can't have it,

118
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:23,839
no one else will either!

119
00:05:26,279 --> 00:05:29,079
I've always wanted to see if your dark magic is faster,

120
00:05:29,079 --> 00:05:30,639
or my gun!

121
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:35,519
Zhang Tianyou!

122
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:36,720
Zhang Tianyou!

123
00:05:37,279 --> 00:05:39,240
I thought you had some real skills.

124
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:40,240
That's it?

125
00:05:44,839 --> 00:05:45,759
Jiushuang,

126
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:47,800
now you can come back with me.

127
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:57,120
It seems

128
00:05:57,879 --> 00:05:59,959
you still don't have what it takes.

129
00:05:59,959 --> 00:06:01,240
You don't deserve this thing at all.

130
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:02,319
I'll keep it safe for you.

131
00:06:02,839 --> 00:06:04,680
Apologize properly to Miss Mei,

132
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:08,319
and stop coveting any family of Wan Mei Qi Sheng.

133
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:10,120
You're not worthy.

134
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:16,480
Retreat! Retreat!

135
00:06:22,959 --> 00:06:24,199
If I may say so, Young Master,

136
00:06:24,839 --> 00:06:26,079
we're just letting them go?

137
00:06:26,399 --> 00:06:28,759
What use do I have keeping an idiot like him?

138
00:06:28,959 --> 00:06:29,800
Wait, let me see.

139
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:30,839
Where's your bullet hole?

140
00:06:30,839 --> 00:06:32,079
Hey, don't, don't, don't!

141
00:06:32,079 --> 00:06:32,480
What's going on?

142
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:33,439
What's this inside?

143
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:35,040
The Dragon Scale Armor.

144
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:37,120
How do you have the legendary Dragon Scale Armor?

145
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:37,680
This, this...

146
00:06:37,680 --> 00:06:38,759
Never mind about that.

147
00:06:39,040 --> 00:06:42,079
Anyway, I did what I promised you.

148
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:43,800
Zhang Tianyou!

149
00:06:44,639 --> 00:06:46,279
Did I, your first wife,

150
00:06:46,439 --> 00:06:48,040
interrupt your good time?

151
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:57,000
Zhang Tianyou, you bastard!

152
00:06:57,600 --> 00:07:00,000
He ruined your brother's legs,

153
00:07:00,120 --> 00:07:01,879
and I haven't even settled the score with him yet.

154
00:07:03,160 --> 00:07:05,879
He actually used a fake Curse Scripture

155
00:07:06,480 --> 00:07:09,959
to swindle my tiny plot of land!

156
00:07:11,639 --> 00:07:13,959
Doesn't he like land?

157
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:17,240
I'll give him a graveyard!

158
00:07:17,480 --> 00:07:18,639
Understood, Father.

159
00:07:18,639 --> 00:07:20,160
I guarantee he'll rest in peace.

160
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:25,920
Zhang Tianyou is the live-in son-in-law of my Sheng family.

161
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:27,199
Even as a ghost, he still is.

162
00:07:27,199 --> 00:07:28,319
Now get out!

163
00:07:35,160 --> 00:07:36,639
Miss Sheng's temper

164
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:39,720
is about to burn the house down.

165
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:40,839
I'm used to it.

166
00:07:44,759 --> 00:07:45,600
Zhang Tianyou,

167
00:07:46,639 --> 00:07:48,360
those two damaged Puppet Corpses

168
00:07:49,439 --> 00:07:52,240
were fed my Mei family's Five Venomous Creatures,

169
00:07:53,040 --> 00:07:54,279
which is how the Celestial Seal

170
00:07:54,439 --> 00:07:56,720
and my special spices controlled them.

171
00:07:58,319 --> 00:08:00,319
They used to be living people, too.

172
00:08:02,240 --> 00:08:03,120
Understood.

173
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:03,959
Rat,

174
00:08:04,959 --> 00:08:05,839
pack up.

175
00:08:05,839 --> 00:08:06,800
We act after dark.

176
00:08:07,240 --> 00:08:08,040
Got it.

177
00:08:22,040 --> 00:08:22,680
Young Master.

178
00:08:23,079 --> 00:08:24,680
A kind-hearted person like Miss Mei

179
00:08:24,680 --> 00:08:26,399
is rare to find in our line of work.

180
00:08:27,360 --> 00:08:28,839
A kind heart is a good thing,

181
00:08:28,920 --> 00:08:30,759
but it can easily cause trouble sometimes.

182
00:08:34,120 --> 00:08:34,919
Zhang Tianyou,

183
00:08:37,440 --> 00:08:39,679
how do you know about our Mei family's Celestial Seal?

184
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:41,759
And where did you get the Dragon Scale Armor?

185
00:08:41,799 --> 00:08:42,919
Let me tell you, Miss Mei.

186
00:08:42,919 --> 00:08:45,039
Our Young Master knows more than just the Celestial Seal.

187
00:08:45,039 --> 00:08:46,039
He also knows about the Talisman Book,

188
00:08:46,039 --> 00:08:46,799
and the Curse Scripture.

189
00:08:47,159 --> 00:08:47,519
I mean,

190
00:08:47,519 --> 00:08:48,639
he's no ordinary man.

191
00:08:48,639 --> 00:08:49,480
Our Young Master...

192
00:08:49,480 --> 00:08:50,720
Well, our Young Master...

193
00:08:57,840 --> 00:08:58,679
It's a Sealed Door!

194
00:08:58,679 --> 00:08:59,559
A Sealed Door!

195
00:09:00,039 --> 00:09:01,879
Someone wants to trap us in here like dumpling filling.
